#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/Working-with-interfaces/Single-Package-Define-And-Use-Interface.rst:74
msgid "Steps"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/Working-with-interfaces/Single-Package-Define-And-Use-Interface.rst:78
msgid ""
"For our examples, we are using the ``msg`` interface type, but the steps "
"below apply to all interface types."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/Working-with-interfaces/Single-Package-Define-And-Use-Interface.rst:80
msgid ""
"In your workspace ``src`` folder, create a ``more_interfaces`` CMake package "
"with a folder for interface definitions. For example:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/Working-with-interfaces/Single-Package-Define-And-Use-Interface.rst:83
msgid ""
"$ ros2 pkg create --build-type ament_cmake more_interfaces\n"
"$ mkdir -p more_interfaces/msg"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/Working-with-interfaces/Single-Package-Define-And-Use-Interface.rst:90
msgid ""
"In ROS 2, interfaces can only be defined in CMake packages. You can also use "
"`ament_cmake_python <https://github.com/ament/ament_cmake/tree/rolling/"
"ament_cmake_python>`__ to include Python libraries and nodes in a CMake "
"package."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/Working-with-interfaces/Single-Package-Define-And-Use-Interface.rst:93
msgid ""
"In your interface definitions folder, create a file in which you provide the "
"definitions for the interface. For example, for a message interface, you can "
"create an ``AddressBook.msg`` file that collects personal data: The "
"``PHONE_TYPE_*`` constants in this example form an enumerated type pattern "
"for ``phone_type`` values."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/Working-with-interfaces/Single-Package-Define-And-Use-Interface.rst:97
msgid ""
"uint8 PHONE_TYPE_HOME=0\n"
"uint8 PHONE_TYPE_WORK=1\n"
"uint8 PHONE_TYPE_MOBILE=2\n"
"string first_name\n"
"string last_name\n"
"string phone_number\n"
"uint8 phone_type\n"
"geometry_msgs/Point location"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/Working-with-interfaces/Single-Package-Define-And-Use-Interface.rst:108
msgid ""
"In ``package.xml``, add the following code to register your package as part "
"of interface groups: ``rosidl_default_generators``: Needed to generate the "
"code during the build. ``rosidl_default_runtime``: Needed only at run time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/Working-with-interfaces/Single-Package-Define-And-Use-Interface.rst:112
msgid ""
"<depend>rclcpp</depend>\n"
"<buildtool_depend>rosidl_default_generators</buildtool_depend>\n"
"<exec_depend>rosidl_default_runtime</exec_depend>\n"
"<depend>geometry_msgs</depend>\n"
"<member_of_group>rosidl_interface_packages</member_of_group>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/Working-with-interfaces/Single-Package-Define-And-Use-Interface.rst:120
msgid ""
"In ``CMakeLists.txt``, add the required code to make the runtime libraries "
"available and to generate source files from your interface definition. For "
"example:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/Working-with-interfaces/Single-Package-Define-And-Use-Interface.rst:123
msgid ""
"find_package(rosidl_default_generators REQUIRED)\n"
"find_package(geometry_msgs REQUIRED)\n"
"set(msg_files \"msg/AddressBook.msg\")\n"
"rosidl_generate_interfaces(${PROJECT_NAME} ${msg_files}\n"
"  DEPENDENCIES geometry_msgs\n"
")\n"
"ament_export_dependencies(rosidl_default_runtime)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/Working-with-interfaces/Single-Package-Define-And-Use-Interface.rst:133
msgid ""
"In the ``more_interfaces/src`` folder, create a node to interact with your "
"new interface. For example, for a message interface, create "
"``publish_address_book.cpp`` with code to publish the message periodically."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/Working-with-interfaces/Single-Package-Define-And-Use-Interface.rst:136
msgid ""
"#include <chrono>\n"
"#include <iostream>\n"
"#include <memory>\n"
"\n"
"#include \"rclcpp/rclcpp.hpp\"\n"
"#include \"more_interfaces/msg/address_book.hpp\"\n"
"\n"
"using namespace std::chrono_literals;\n"
"\n"
"class AddressBookPublisher : public rclcpp::Node\n"
"{\n"
"public:\n"
"  AddressBookPublisher()\n"
"  : Node(\"address_book_publisher\")\n"
"  {\n"
"    address_book_publisher_ =\n"
"      this-"
">create_publisher<more_interfaces::msg::AddressBook>(\"address_book\", 10);\n"
"\n"
"    auto publish_msg = [this]() -> void {\n"
"        auto message = more_interfaces::msg::AddressBook();\n"
"\n"
"        message.first_name = \"John\";\n"
"        message.last_name = \"Doe\";\n"
"        message.phone_number = \"1234567890\";\n"
"        message.phone_type = message.PHONE_TYPE_MOBILE;\n"
"        message.location.x = 37.7749;\n"
"        message.location.y = -122.4194;\n"
"        message.location.z = 0.0;\n"
"\n"
"        std::cout << \"Publishing Contact\\nFirst:\" << message.first_name "
"<<\n"
"          \"  Last:\" << message.last_name << std::endl;\n"
"\n"
"        this->address_book_publisher_->publish(message);\n"
"      };\n"
"    timer_ = this->create_wall_timer(1s, publish_msg);\n"
"  }\n"
"\n"
"private:\n"
"  rclcpp::Publisher<more_interfaces::msg::AddressBook>::SharedPtr "
"address_book_publisher_;\n"
"  rclcpp::TimerBase::SharedPtr timer_;\n"
"};\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"int main(int argc, char * argv[])\n"
"{\n"
"  rclcpp::init(argc, argv);\n"
"  rclcpp::spin(std::make_shared<AddressBookPublisher>());\n"
"  rclcpp::shutdown();\n"
"\n"
"  return 0;\n"
"}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/Working-with-interfaces/Single-Package-Define-And-Use-Interface.rst:190
msgid ""
"In ``CMakeLists.txt``, create a new target so the node builds correctly. For "
"example:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/Working-with-interfaces/Single-Package-Define-And-Use-Interface.rst:193
msgid ""
"find_package(rclcpp REQUIRED)\n"
"add_executable(publish_address_book src/publish_address_book.cpp)\n"
"target_link_libraries(publish_address_book rclcpp::rclcpp)\n"
"install(TARGETS publish_address_book DESTINATION lib/${PROJECT_NAME})"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/Working-with-interfaces/Single-Package-Define-And-Use-Interface.rst:200
msgid "In ``CMakeLists.txt``, link the node to your interface. For example:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/Working-with-interfaces/Single-Package-Define-And-Use-Interface.rst:203
msgid ""
"rosidl_get_typesupport_target(cpp_typesupport_target ${PROJECT_NAME} "
"rosidl_typesupport_cpp)\n"
"target_link_libraries(publish_address_book \"${cpp_typesupport_target}\")"
msgstr ""

